💭 Its methods are specialized, as its instance variables are represented the same for every T.
🕊 🔲🐚T 📦🍆 🍇
  🐊 🧾
  🖍🆕 values 🍨🐚T🍆

  🆕 🍇
    🍿🍆 ➡️ 🖍values
  🍉

  🖍❗️ 🐻 value T 🍇
    🐻values value❗️
  🍉

  ❗️ 🧮 ➡️ 🔢 🍇
