💭 Stores T boxed, which its specialized methods read and write through the box.
🕊 🎁🐚T 🔼🍆 🍇
  🖍🆕 value T
  🖍🆕 previous T
  🆕 🍼 value T 🍇
    value ➡️ 🖍previous
  🍉
  ❗️ 🔓 ➡️ T 🍇
    ↩️ value
  🍉
  🖍❗️ 🔄 new T 🍇
    value ➡️ 🖍previous
    new ➡️ 🖍value
  🍉
  ❗️ 🧮 ➡️ 🔢 🍇
    ↩️ 📏 value❗️ ➕ 📏 previous❗️
  🍉
  🖍❗️ 🆙 ➡️ 🔢 🍇
    ↩️ ⬆️value❗️
  🍉
🍉

💭 Stores an optional T, which specialized methods do not support, so they are not specialized.
🕊 🎀🐚T ⚪🍆 🍇
  🖍🆕 value T
  🖍🆕 spare 🍬T
  🆕 🍼 value T 🍇
    🤷‍♀️ ➡️ 🖍spare
  🍉
  ❗️ 🔓 ➡️ T 🍇
    ↩️ value
  🍉
🍉

💭 Stores a closure that takes a boxed T, so its methods are not specialized.
🕊 🏭🐚T ⚪🍆 🍇
  🖍🆕 make 🍇🔢➡️T🍉
  🆕 🍼 make 🍇🔢➡️T🍉 🍇🍉
  ❗️ 🔨 n 🔢 ➡️ T 🍇
    ↩️ ⁉️ make n❗️
  🍉
🍉

💭 Class methods are not specialized, so this reads values that specialized methods stored.
